window.products.push({"id":341527,"name":"Silicone Ice Cube Tray with Lid, 3 pack(108 Ice cubes), Easy-Release Ice Trays with Spill-Resistant Removable Lid, LFGB Certified & BPA Free, Stackabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UxahC66NL._AC_SL1189_.jpg","description":"Ice tray Standard Water Level: Please don't add too much water to this ice cube trays in case sticking to the lid. Removable Lids : The ice cube trays easy to stacked, prevent spills and keep ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. Easy Ice Release Flexible and easily push from the ice cube trays bottom to release the cubes. Easy to Clean You can put this ice cube trays under the water tap to wash after use. Of course, it is also dishwasher safe. Specifications: Name: Ice cube trays Material: Food Grade Silicone Color: Green & Blue Ice Cubes: 36/piece * 3 pack Dimensions: 9.92\" x 3.9\" x 1.14\" Cube size: 0.98\" x 0.98\" Temperature: -22℉ ~ 446℉ Package Included: 3* Ice Cube Trays Warm Tips: 1. Do not use metal brush to clean these ice cube trays. 2. Do not clean the ice cube trays with strong detergent in case they get corroded. 3. Keep these ice cube trays away from fire sources in case they get distorted. 4. The water level should be lower 3-4 mm in case the ice expands and sticks together. 5. Wait 2 minutes after taking out the trays from the fridge for easy pop out of ice cubes. 6. Since the silicone material will absorb the odor after a long time use, just wash it with boiling water to remove it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UxahC66NL._AC_SL1189_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pollason","source_asin":"B08BKQ9F99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-341527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BKQ9F99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BKQ9F99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
