window.products.push({"id":341534,"name":"fullengy Cervical Memory Foam Pillow, Contour Pillows for Neck, Shoulder, Back Pain Relief, Ergonomic Neck Contoured Support Pillow for Side, Back, St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7120js7p9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎟 REDUCE NECK & BACK PAIN -- Proven ergonomically designed, Fullengy contoured memory foam pillow supports your head, neck, shoulders and back perfectly, which can bring a reduction of stress in the cervical vertebra and spine. So you will wake up relaxed without any neck and shoulder pain. And this pillow is comfortable whether you are back sleeper, stomach sleeper, or side sleeper ♥ ERGONOMIC DESIGN & QUALITY MATERIAL -- Pillows play a crucial role in pain. With the butterfly shape, neck contour, and central cavity, our contour pillow can support by following the natural curve of your body, and give your arms armrests. The hole inside was designed to cradle your head for optimal support and reduce the pressure of the skull ❣ TWO HEIGHTS & ARMREST DESIGN -- The size of the pillow is 25.6 x 14.2 x (3.1 - 5.5 ) inch (L*W*H). Back sleepers with cervical issues can sleep on the higher side (5.5 inch) of the pillow with 2 horns as this side provides better support for the head and cervical. All the other back/side sleepers can sleep on the lower side (3.1inch). And the armrest design offers specific grooves that allows your arms to go under for comfortable sleep 🧮 HIGH QUALITY MEMORY FOAM PILLOW -- The cervical pillow is made of premium and breathable memory foam with a CertiPUR-US certified rebound time of 3 to 5 seconds, which can keep its shape and firmness for long term use. And the pillow cover is made of 100% polyester that can let you fees silky soft and cool. All materials are breathable, skin-friendly, and chemical free 💦 REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE -- The Cervical Memory Foam Pillow with breathable fabric cover allows extra airflow into the pillow to keep the pillow cool while you sleep. It is gentle on your skin to stay crisp throughout the night. And the the pillowcase is removable with zippered & machine washable 💝 It's the optimum neck pillows for people who needs pain relief, no matter for elders, office workers, teachers, IT, or having sleep disorders 👨‍⚕️ NOTE: IF YOU NEED TO USE IT FOR REHABILITATION, PLEASE ASK YOUR DOCTOR FOR ADVICE FIRST. 🌞 Memory foam will have a slight polyurethane smell, and the smell may be more obvious after passing through a high temperature and airtight transportation environment. This is a normal phenomenon. Before first use, unzip and remove the lid and leave the memory foam flat in a well-ventilated area for 1-3 days until it fully expands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7120js7p9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fullengy","source_asin":"B0BK3DSKGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-341534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK3DSKGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK3DSKGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
