window.products.push({"id":341631,"name":"Bamboo Cooking Utensils - Reusable & Sustainable Cutlery Set, Organic Travel Utensil Set With Case (20 x 4.5 cm), 6 Piece Set for Camping, Office or H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81usUkGT-LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We at Dove Decor strive to save the planet in every possible way. YOUR HELP to keep the environment clean will go a long way. THANK YOU for supporting this initiative! At the same time, your satisfaction is our number 1 priority and we pride our customer service. Your purchase is covered by our 100% satisfaction guaranteed. 🔷 Judge Us, Through Our Customers! “Sturdy quality, easy to clean, case they come in is a portable size and lets the utensils dry.” “These utensils have become my new favorite lunch accessory. I use them for breakfast and lunch at work.” “It’s compact, sustainable, and easy to carry with.” “This set comes with everything needed to travel with. It fits perfectly in my backpack for use on planes and in hotels” 🔷 Bamboo Is What We Need Now! ✔ Environmentally Friendly: It grows faster than wood, and is safer than plastic. ✔ Strong and Durable: Tough and lightweight, just what makes life easier. ✔ Safe to Use with Cookware: Unlike metals, they do not damage your non-stick cookware utensil sets ✔ Attractive Appearance: Kitchen organizer with a beautiful design and a classy look to present yourself ✔ Affordable Price: Sturdy to be re-used again and again with proper care. 🔷 Care For Them And They’ll Care For You - Wash gently with hands and dry them immediately. It is strictly advised not to put in the dishwasher. - Do not leave them wet for a longer period so they may wear off quickly. - Rehydrate them periodically to increase their lives. Note: When the set is new, you may experience a woody scent while in use. To avoid, simply soak the cutlery set (not tube) in water for one night and use it when dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81usUkGT-LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dove Decor","source_asin":"B07PZKGGYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-341631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PZKGGYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PZKGGYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
