window.products.push({"id":341878,"name":"Squeeze Me, I Dare You. All Natural, Nothing Artificial. Fun Funny Coffee Mug. Cool Cute Humorous Tea Cup Gift, Bright Yellow Lemon for Unique Quirky ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q3VupdvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍉 And you do: you love him or her …to squeeze you! And yes, you are all naturalmake time to tell your loved one how much you want to give them a big squeeze! 🍉 This mug says it all! 🍉 And are they squeezable or what? Squeeze a friend or lover… so natural! She’ll love seeing those words from YOU and so will HE!🍉 This is the gift to bring a smile … and the one you love willfeel those words, that feeling of being admired and loved... with every sip.🍉 A great gift for any time, Christmas, birthday, anniversary -- or just because you want to bring a smile or chuckle! 🍉 And other guys, other gals, will look at that and go … ‘oooh, how sweet!’And you might sense a touch of envy, too!🍉 To lift people up, bring a smile, a laugh … that’s our work at Watermelon Heads. We create mugs with words which lift people up, bring a smile, a laugh,a few moments of happiness. Our quotes and sayings are original.No copycats! Just fun, unique words. 🍉 You’ll find a few of our other mugs on Amazon, and we have more in the works.We design and print our mugs here in Edmonds WA, and the mugs are made in China by good folks who work hard. 🍉 We all need to be lifted up in this crazy, beautiful world. And a simple gift of a coffee mug, with words which bring a warm smile,reminds that person that he or she is important to you, special, beautiful and of course squeezable.Sometimes it’s in the smallest of ways that we make the world a better place. 🍉 ‘Surround yourself with people who lift you higher.’ That's one of our favorite quotes. Let’s be the ones who lift others higher.! 🍉 You're more important to us than the money. If you're unhappy with your mug at any time, for any reason, just let us know.1. We'll replace it, or 2. send you one of our other mugs, or 3. refund your money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q3VupdvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERMELON HEADS","source_asin":"B08L1MRN4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-341878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L1MRN4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L1MRN4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":341879,"name":"ALIMORDEN Kids Ultra-Soft Snuggle Foam Filled Chair, Single Cuddly Sherpa Reading Couch for Boys and Girls, Light Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y3cdbB+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Medium High Back Support: This fluffy toddler chair is especially designed for little ones so they have a spot for reading, relaxing or snuggling. The soft medium high back sherpa chair can support kids well. A good gift for babies. Lightweight Design: Kids Chair is lightweight and has a handle for easy moving this mini sofa to the bedroom, living room, balcony, playroom, etc. Beautiful Pure Color fabric easy to coordinate. Comfortable & Soft Touching: Toddler armchair cover is made of 100% extra soft and cuddly durable cotton. Soft and cozy. Vairous Colors for your choice, Lime Green, Cream and Grey. Safety & Comfortable Design: Made of thick foam ensure that it doesn’t get ruined by little feet jumping on it or climbing over it. Put together well. The entire sofa has no sharp corners or hard edges to ensure the safety of the child. And the kids sofa 'arms' has a good support, don’t worry about rolling to the floor. Easy to Remove Cover: Armchair comes with a removable machine-washable slipcover that zips off for easy cleaning. Machine wash in cold water and dry on lowest temperature setting. No installation Required: The toddler chair is in vacuum packing. Just take out and plump up for hours. 24 hours is better for reaching its full size. Enjoy it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y3cdbB+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALIMORDEN","source_asin":"B09C1QJWB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-341879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C1QJWB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C1QJWB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
